  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INRUD adherence to ARV - INRUD indic of antimicrob</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">INRUD adherence to ARV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARV programs in five African countries will be evaluated according to pre validated adherence indicators. A model ARV program with the best adherence rates will be chosen and piloted. The program is supervised by a specially formed Technical Advisory Group with experts from WHO, Karolinska Institute(IHCAR), Harward Medical School and Management Sciences for Health (MSH).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xF6;r distribution av bromsmediciner utv&#xE4;rderas mot ett pilottestade indikatorer f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rskrivningsinstruktioner. Den modell som visat b&#xE4;st resultat v&#xE4;ljs ut och testas i st&#xF6;rre skala. insatsen f&#xF6;ljs av en teknisk grupp med experter fr&#xE5;n WHO, Karolinska  Institutet, Harvard och Management for Health i USA.</narrative>
  </description>
